   board P: 2 declarations (apply_gen_sch_p_intent.py, inserted before the intent is written)
     SRP_F: -0.200 to +0.200 V. SRP_F: the BQ4050's SRP input (pin 8) reached through R8 100R from GND, the coulomb counter's filtered side of the 2 mOhm shunt R10 between GND and PACK_N. TI SLUSC67B 6.3 (p.8) recommends SRP and SRN within -0.2 to +0.2 V (6.1, absolute maximum -0.3 to +0.3 V); the shunt drops 36 mV at the pack's declared 18 A peak (PACK_N's rail), and the AFE's short-circuit trips SCD1 and SCC are at most 200 mV across it (6.31, p.16, CONTROL[RSNS] = 0). Operating case: discharge or charge up to the short-circuit trip; round 5 of record l6r2
     SRN_F: -0.200 to +0.200 V. SRN_F: the BQ4050's SRN input (pin 6) reached through R9 100R from PACK_N, the coulomb counter's filtered side of the 2 mOhm shunt R10 between GND and PACK_N. TI SLUSC67B 6.3 (p.8) recommends SRP and SRN within -0.2 to +0.2 V (6.1, absolute maximum -0.3 to +0.3 V); the shunt drops 36 mV at the pack's declared 18 A peak (PACK_N's rail), and the AFE's short-circuit trips SCD1 and SCC are at most 200 mV across it (6.31, p.16, CONTROL[RSNS] = 0). Operating case: discharge or charge up to the short-circuit trip; round 5 of record l6r2
