     WA_ANT: -10.620 to +10.620 V. the lead to A22's P2P jack (J_WOA), chain A: the AsiaRF AW7915-AED's highest conducted output is 23 dBm +/- 1.5 dB (11b, datasheet V1.0 p.3), 24.5 dBm, which is 5.31 V peak into 50 Ohm and 10.62 V with the lead fully reflecting (an open or shorted antenna, the case board B's LORA_ANT declares). DC: none (an antenna lead, DC blocked on the switch side). Operating case: transmit at full power into any load; round 5 of record l6r2
